sequenceDiagram

  actor C as Clinician (browser)
  participant API as Express API
  participant M as MongoDB
  participant G as Fabric Gateway (peer)
  participant CC as EHR chaincode
  participant O as Raft orderer
  rect rgb(240,247,244)
  Note over C,O: A. Create a record
  C->>API: POST /api/records (JWT)
  API->>API: validate (Zod), AES-256-GCM encrypt, SHA-256 hash
  API->>M: save encrypted payload + hash
  API->>G: endorse CreateRecord(recordId, patientId, hash)
  G->>CC: simulate on Org1 and Org2 peers
  CC-->>G: check author rights, write anchor + audit event
  API->>G: submit endorsed transaction
  G->>O: order into block
  O-->>G: block committed on every peer
  API-->>C: 201 recordId + ledger tx id
  end
  rect rgb(244,246,251)
  Note over C,O: B. Open a record (audited, consent-checked)
  C->>API: GET /api/records/:id
  API->>G: submit AccessRecord(recordId, actorId)
  G->>CC: check consent (owner / active / scope / expiry / org)
  CC-->>G: ALLOWED or DENIED + audit event on ledger
  alt denied
    API-->>C: 403 Access denied (attempt logged)
  else allowed
    API->>M: fetch encrypted payload
    API->>API: recompute SHA-256, compare with ledger hash
    alt hashes differ
      API-->>C: 409 INTEGRITY_VIOLATION
    else hashes match
      API->>API: decrypt
      API-->>C: 200 record + integrity proof
    end
  end
  end
